{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-attention-vision","title":"视觉自注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/self-attention-vision","wordCount":1248,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"positional-encoding-2d","title":"二维位置编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/positional-encoding-2d","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"cls-token-pooling","title":"类别 token 与池化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/cls-token-pooling","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"架构\">架构</h1><p>一个标准 ViT 拆开看，只有三样东西真正区别于「图像版的语言 Transformer」，这一章把这三样讲透。</p>\n<p>第一样是自注意力用在视觉上时的行为。同样是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QK^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但 token 现在是空间里的 patch，注意力图带有空间语义，而那个让人头疼的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度也正是从这里诞生的。<a href=\"self-attention-vision\">视觉自注意力</a> 既讲机制，也讲清这个复杂度——它是后面「变体」章一切高效化努力的起点。</p>\n<p>第二样是位置信息。自注意力对输入顺序天然无感，可图像里「左上」和「右下」绝不能混。<a href=\"positional-encoding-2d\">二维位置编码</a> 梳理从可学习一维位置、到二维分解、再到 2025 年 DINOv3 改用 RoPE 支持任意分辨率的演进，解释为什么换分辨率推理会出问题、又怎么解决。</p>\n<p>第三样是怎么从一串 patch token 得到一个图像级表示。<a href=\"cls-token-pooling\">类别 token 与池化</a> 对比 CLS token 与全局平均池化两条路线，并引出「注册 token（register）」为什么能消除注意力图里的伪影。</p>\n<p>这三篇按「先有 token 间关系（注意力）→ 给关系注入空间（位置）→ 从关系里读出结论（池化）」的逻辑递进，正好走完一个 ViT 从输入序列到输出表示的内部流程。读这一章前请确保已经理解 <a href=\"../foundations/patch-embedding\">图像分块与嵌入</a>，因为这里讨论的 token 就是那一步产出的。</p>\n"}